---
import Icon from '@/components/Icon.astro'
import { links } from '@/data/site'
---

<section aria-labelledby="h-final" class="final">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="final-bg"></div>

  <div class="final-inner reveal">
    <p class="final-kicker">끊김 없는 업무, AI 기반 인수인계 자동화 서비스</p>
    <h2 id="h-final">지금 갖고 있는 자료로<br />첫 인수인계서를 만들어 보세요</h2>
    <p class="final-sub">업로드부터 후임자 Q&A까지, 회원가입 후 바로 사용할 수 있어요.</p>

    <div class="final-actions">
      <a class="btn-primary btn-lg breathe" href={links.app} rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">
        무료로 시작하기
        <Icon name="arrow" />
      </a>
      <a class="btn-link" href={links.demo} rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">시연 영상 보기</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .final {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 140px max(5vw, 24px);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .final-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(60% 80% at 50% 110%, rgb(49 130 246 / 18%), transparent),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--surface), var(--bg));
  }

  .final-bg::before,
  .final-bg::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 420px;
    height: 420px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    opacity: 0.5;
    filter: blur(70px);
    animation: drift 12s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }

  .final-bg::before {
    bottom: -160px;
    left: -120px;
    background: var(--blue-7);
  }

  .final-bg::after {
    top: -160px;
    right: -120px;
    background: var(--blue-5);
    animation-delay: -6s;
  }

  .final-inner {
    position: relative;
  }

  .final-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: var(--blue-dark);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .final h2 {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4.6vw, 48px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .final-sub {
    margin: 0 0 32px;
    color: var(--sub);
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .final-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .final-actions .btn-link {
    height: 58px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 0 22px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .final {
      padding: 96px 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
